<!-- Simplified collision/visual model of SD_BRS1_Assembly2.
     Inertials, joint origins, axes, types and limits are copied verbatim from that file, so this
     model is dynamically identical and a policy trained here transfers to the original asset.
     Mesh geometry is replaced by primitives chosen so that no two non-adjacent links of the same
     leg overlap at any reachable joint configuration, which the original mesh model violated
     (Link4 penetrated Link6 permanently, producing spurious contact forces). -->
